B.aHn=s(["Nutrition tracks the food side of the System: ingredients, recipes, shopping notes, and daily intake.","Kitchen items can be added, edited, removed, and used by recipes.","Recipes help turn saved ingredients into repeatable meal plans.","Daily logs record food intake so the app can keep nutrition history alongside your progression.","Monthly audit mail reminds you to review your body stats, but weight can be updated once per day from Status."],t.s)
B.aZU=new A.kQ(B.pP,"NUTRITION","Kitchen inventory, recipes, intake logs, and food tracking.",B.In,B.aHn)
B.aH4=s(["Library is a saved-link archive for anything you want to revisit.","You can add links, search them, reorder entries, edit old records, and delete what you no longer need.","Opening a link uses the in-app viewer when possible, with a fallback to the browser.","It is meant for quick access to references, anime pages, tools, trackers, school links, work links, or guides."],t.s)
B.aZV=new A.kQ(B.x3,"LIBRARY","A personal archive for links and resources.",B.b6,B.aH4)
B.Y2=new A.bz(58475,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aHs=s(["Theme lets you set separate background images for Labyrinth, Nutrition, Library, and Status.","A shared dim overlay keeps text and cards readable over custom images.","Theme images are bound to the signed-in Firebase account, so Google and anonymous profiles stay separate on the same device.","On web builds, the image picker opens from the Theme menu item in the Labyrinth drawer."],t.s)
B.aZY=new A.kQ(B.Y2,"THEME","Per-tab background images with account-bound cloud sync.",B.aN,B.aHs)
