B.aHw=s(["Signing in binds your progression to a Firebase account so it can restore on another device.","If local progress already exists and the cloud profile is new, the app can migrate local save data into the cloud.","The first setup asks for your Monarch name, height, and weight. The chosen name becomes your in-game name.","Goal doc name can store a custom Google Doc title and link for quick access from the drawer.","System Mail stores important notices, including player-selection, monthly audit reminders, and silent update notices.","History records quest clears, reward claims, level ups, streak events, mass entries, and food logs."],t.s)
B.aZX=new A.kQ(B.XT,"SYSTEM ACCOUNT","Cloud save, login, onboarding, mail, and local-save migration.",B.aKg,B.aHw)
